  language: 1
  dialogues:
  - <shake><color=#FF00FF>SONNY!</color> </shake>I wasn't expecting you here. Through
    this path I used to reach the forest, and play.
  - The woods are full of <color=#FF00FF>interconnected passageways</color>, but
    since these <color=#00FFFF>vines</color> appeared, they became impossible to
    traverse.
  - If only nothing could hurt me, even for a few seconds only...
